# Memory Directory

This folder contains daily memory files.

## Structure
- `YYYY-MM-DD.md` - Daily conversation logs
- `diary/YYYY-MM-DD.md` - Consciousness tick logs
- `projects/<name>.md` - Project-specific context

## Retention
- Daily files: 7 days active, then archive
- Diary: 30 days active
- Projects: Until completion + 7 days
